From: liviyifan <344781483+liviyifan@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: nginx: ngx_js_engine casts to ngx_uint_t *

The engine field is ngx_uint_t, but the pointer is cast to size_t *. They
are the same type on LP64; on AArch64 ILP32 size_t is unsigned long and
ngx_uint_t unsigned int, and GCC 14 rejects the assignment.

---
--- a/nginx-mod-njs/nginx/ngx_js.c
+++ b/nginx-mod-njs/nginx/ngx_js.c
@@ -3113,7 +3113,7 @@
     ngx_uint_t          *type, m;
     ngx_conf_bitmask_t  *mask;
 
-    type = (size_t *) (p + cmd->offset);
+    type = (ngx_uint_t *) (p + cmd->offset);
     if (*type != NGX_CONF_UNSET_UINT) {
         return "is duplicate";
     }
